OL,3,GNEWSAMan's body recovered from sea at
OL,4,ACleethorpes beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a man has been recovered
OL,7,Ffrom the sea in Cleethorpes, police
OL,8,Fhave said.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FCleethorpes beach at about 14:00 BST on
OL,12,FMonday, Humberside Police said.
OL,14,FA spokesperson said: "Despite the
OL,15,Fefforts of medical professionals, a man
OL,16,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene."
OL,18,FThe force said the man's death was not
OL,19,Fbeing treated as suspicious and his
OL,20,Ffamily had been informed.
